          "type": "mc",
          "difficulty": "hard",
          "stem": "A box of cereal has a gross mass (box + contents) of \\(850\\text{ g}\\). The empty box weighs \\(60\\text{ g}\\). What is the net mass of the cereal alone?",
          "options": [
            "\\(790\\text{ g}\\)",
            "\\(910\\text{ g}\\)",
            "\\(60\\text{ g}\\)",
            "\\(850\\text{ g}\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "hint": "Net mass = gross mass − mass of the container.",
          "steps": [
